{"source":{"uri":"Features/StringActions.feature","data":"Feature: String Utility Operations\r\n  In order to reuse common string functionalities\r\n  As a tester\r\n  I want to validate different string operations using the String Utility class\r\n\r\n  Background:\r\n    Given I have a base string \"Hello World from Automation Testing\"\r\n\r\n  @Split\r\n  Scenario: Split string by a word\r\n    When I split the string by \" \"\r\n    Then the result should contain 5 parts\r\n\r\n  @Contains\r\n  Scenario: Check if string contains a word\r\n    When I check if the string contains \"World\"\r\n    Then the result should be true\r\n\r\n  @NotContains\r\n  Scenario: Check if string does not contain a word\r\n    When I check if the string contains \"Selenium\"\r\n    Then the result should be false\r\n\r\n  @Equals\r\n  Scenario: Compare two strings\r\n    Given I have another string \"Hello World from Automation Testing\"\r\n    When I compare both strings\r\n    Then the strings should be equal\r\n\r\n  @IgnoreCaseEquals\r\n  Scenario: Compare two strings ignoring case\r\n    Given I have another string \"hello world from automation testing\"\r\n    When I compare both strings ignoring case\r\n    Then the strings should be equal\r\n\r\n  @Replace\r\n  Scenario: Replace word in string\r\n    When I replace \"World\" with \"Universe\"\r\n    Then the updated string should be \"Hello Universe from Automation Testing\"\r\n\r\n  @Substring\r\n  Scenario: Extract substring\r\n    When I extract substring from index 6 to 11\r\n    Then the result should be \"World\"\r\n\r\n  @StartsWith\r\n  Scenario: Check if string starts with a word\r\n    When I check if string starts with \"Hello\"\r\n    Then the result should be true\r\n\r\n  @EndsWith\r\n  Scenario: Check if string ends with a word\r\n    When I check if string ends with \"Testing\"\r\n    Then the result should be true\r\n\r\n  @Length\r\n  Scenario: Get string length\r\n    When I get the length of the string\r\n    Then the length should be 36\r\n\r\n  @Trim\r\n  Scenario: Trim the string\r\n    Given I have a base string \"   Automation   \"\r\n    When I trim the string\r\n    Then the updated string should be \"Automation\"\r\n\r\n  @ToUpper\r\n  Scenario: Convert string to upper case\r\n    When I convert the string to upper case\r\n    Then the updated string should be \"HELLO WORLD FROM AUTOMATION TESTING\"\r\n\r\n  @ToLower\r\n  Scenario: Convert string to lower case\r\n    When I convert the string to lower case\r\n    Then the updated string should be \"hello world from automation testing\"\r\n\r\n  @Reverse\r\n  Scenario: Reverse the string\r\n    When I reverse the string\r\n    Then the updated string should be \"gnitseT noitamotuA morf dlroW olleH\"\r\n\r\n  @CountOccurrences\r\n  Scenario: Count occurrences of a word\r\n    Given I have a base string \"Test Automation Test Framework Test\"\r\n    When I count occurrences of \"Test\"\r\n    Then the count should be 3","mediaType":"text/x.cucumber.gherkin+plain"}}
